{"title":"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/3/8b3a2616732fe5edb81142978f78b16652df7035.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"13\" />, then for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/a/75a139c64be875272133a89cb2061f91ec4cab32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$pq\\ne 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"51\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/2/7627dde2de51c0997b02afeb3bebc9d2c96e4e90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$pr&gt;qr$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />, we have\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/9/c69f432b1e1ef8ff24397bf5905cfb64f02be440.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } -p&gt;-q\\quad \\text{(B) } -p&gt;q\\quad \\text{(C) } 1&gt;-q/p\\quad \\text{(D) } 1&lt;q/p\\quad \\text{(E)  None of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"595\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/3/8b3a2616732fe5edb81142978f78b16652df7035.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/2/7627dde2de51c0997b02afeb3bebc9d2c96e4e90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$pr&gt;qr$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />, we can divide by the positive number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and not change the inequality direction to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/0/f40a674e717c69679dcfba255e218168e9a12f5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p&gt;q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />.  Multiplying by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> (and flipping the inequality sign because we're multiplying by a negative number) leads to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/4/6f405ef3416870e0a7dd05e70dc396ac5fcb1088.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-p &lt; -q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" />, which directly contradicts <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />.  Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> is always false.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/c/29c5eb77b80843bf8b04ade3d2490f605fdd1b56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p &lt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" /> (which is possible but not guaranteed), we can divide the true statement <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/0/f40a674e717c69679dcfba255e218168e9a12f5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p&gt;q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/5/6a5ba1b49dbc9b620cabf03eca558328c0beff9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 &gt; \\frac{q}{p}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"45\" height=\"36\" />.  This contradicts <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />.  Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is sometimes false, which is bad enough to be eliminated.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/d/50dd04943454314015ece2e312ab9f797437a066.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(p, q, r) = (3, 2, 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"137\" height=\"18\" />, then the condition that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/b/a7b1d1a787c48ec94eabbbeb1473ef952ffda075.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$pr &gt; qr$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"15\" /> is satisfied.  However, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/d/63dec48337f00e271d6600523bfe3c8e5cf98d78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-p = -3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"70\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/7/0876f5b5cc06465d4d110633cd1463412131defc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"41\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/a/cfaa9218c92f2d06ab241b759fd5c5100cb1d1ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-p &gt; q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" /> is false for at least this case, eliminating <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/9/e69fc81f85438da17cdadbfe6cc634d56add194b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(p, q, r) = (2, -3, 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"151\" height=\"18\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/b/a7b1d1a787c48ec94eabbbeb1473ef952ffda075.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$pr &gt; qr$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"15\" /> is also satisfied.  However, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/3/eb3a70dcfc9e4a139e95948cebc9710be709f975.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{q}{p} = 1.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"74\" height=\"36\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/9/669f5301e26e297a916a1c1840bd6371299adb89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 &gt; -\\frac{q}{p}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"59\" height=\"36\" /> is false, eliminating <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>All four options do not follow from the premises, leading to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/e/62effaf0d5dc9bfa1d137bed40c4baa73698962d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" /> as the correct answer.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME\" title=\"1970 AHSME\">1970 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1970 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1970\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 31\">31</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 32\">32</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 33\">33</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 34\">34</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 35\">35</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016191249\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.041 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.062 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 275/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2746/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 176/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5797/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   15.582      1 -total\n 67.26%   10.480      1 Template:AHSME_35p_box\n 31.31%    4.879      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:13112:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261016191249 and revision id 167906. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}